Package: STCOS
Title: Spatial Transcriptomics Cell-type Oriented Simulator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yiyan", "Zhang", , "yiyan@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A simulator for spatial transcriptomics data that generates realistic 
    spatial patterns and cell-type specific gene expression profiles preserving gene-gene coexpression.
